// ACTOR_GUARDING_DIALOG :
"P2706661566" "What do you think has Recluse so spooked about this Cole guy?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_GUARDING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_GUARDING_DIALOG :
"P1523931804" "<em><em>Beats me. But orders are orders, even if we don't understand them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2015216198" "We were warned about the Praetorians. We're ready to take you down!"

