// Dialog :
"P952585217" "We've had our ups and downs, {HeroName}, but Mother has to say it's been an absolute <i>pleasure</i> working with you, wouldn't you say? I do believe we've made Praetoria a <i>much</i> safer place. Hm... yes, a much safer place. I will make sure <i>all</i> those <i>bad</i> psychics you brought in are <i>well</i> taken care of, trust me. Yet, your <i>tireless</i> support of Praetoria is still not yet over, {HeroName}. Our <i>dear</i> Emperor Cole has requested your aid with little <i>Anti-Matter</i>."
// RandomFameString :
"P376485030" "I wish I was like {HeroName}, having Mother talk to me personally."

